  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Pangasius and Shrimp Welfare in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to strengthen the sustainability and reputation of Vietnam&#x2019;s aquaculture sector by promoting higher welfare standards for pangasius and shrimp. By aiming to raise awareness, assess welfare conditions, and provide practical tools and guidance, the project seeks to enable healthier produced fish, more responsible farming, and improved access to demanding international markets.</narrative>
  </description>
